{"version":1,"content":"<p>張敬軒12月聯同澳門中樂團合演跨年騷，首次兼任藝術總監，並兼顧更多幕後工作，同時他亦再度活躍社交平台，日前他透露將工作與生活盡量分開，有關生活就選擇不公開，轉在私人帳號分享。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.481037+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T07:24:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.793717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"fdb7d0d8ae7442bda24160ef9086f61ef222ef3c51b60f534728651873016cc7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}